\cf0 \strokec2 For your AI Guardians AI Incident Manager, I recommend a structured, evidence-first LLM enrichment prompt that separates reported claims from verified facts, identifies the role of AI, evaluates causal relationships, and produces practical guidance for enterprise AI decision-makers and transformation consultants.\
Your current dossier already provides a useful foundation: incident metadata, source attribution, AI-generated analysis, organizational guidance, and four epistemic claim categories. The principal improvement is to introduce explicit evidence standards, causal confidence, provenance tracking, and decision-oriented recommendations.\
One important issue in the screenshot: the dossier currently places a source-reported description under Confirmed Facts, even though the confidence is LOW. A published report establishes that a claim was reported; it does not necessarily establish that the underlying claim is independently verified.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

