\cf0 \strokec2 For evaluation, track unsupported-claim rate, citation precision, allegation-to-fact promotion rate, causal overstatement rate, schema validity, and human-review agreement. These provide more meaningful quality signals than asking an LLM whether its analysis is accurate.\
Recommended implementation decision: Keep the OECD incident record immutable, store enrichment as a separately versioned assessment, and expose source evidence alongside every substantive claim. This will let AI Guardians distinguish reported incidents from independently substantiated findings while producing guidance that enterprise decision-makers and consultants can actually test and apply.\
